{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-gr:000054:note_appended:bob-cli-gr.1:df6800716141fb894cf65dfff507462cf754b7e4806b0afab8fec437c531166a","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:20:39Z","actor":"bob-cli-gr.1","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"bob-cli-gr.1","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"PROPOSED FOLLOW-UP: bob periods brief drops linked minutes for tasks archived into done/ notes. linked_minutes in src/native/periods/brief.rs compares the Pomodoro link target with IndexedTask.source_path but never with archive_path. W43 bob root (5h 20m, 21%) therefore lists no tasks, and Finished omits bob completions such as done/bob_done#^root-parent."}}
